  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable sealed Luo Po Valley, so ordinary methods cannot open a way in. Entry needs a rank five open door Gu for the fated ones, and closing that passage needs a refined rank five close door Gu so the way is not left exposed for others.",
        "chapters": [
          517
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_thieving_heaven_demon_venerable",
          "loc_luo_po_valley",
          "gu_open_door_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "While preparing with space path Gu and refinement materials bought on battle merits, Fang Yuan names that pair of requirements for later entry into Luo Po Valley. Close door Gu’s stated job in that stretch is to shut the passage after open door Gu has let someone in.",
        "chapters": [
          517
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "purpose",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He later states that he has already refined the key to enter the inheritance: open door Gu and close door Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          731
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-keys",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "He still holds both when Hei Lou Lan presses him to retrieve Luo Po Valley, and he shows them openly because they will be used anyway.",
        "chapters": [
          952
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "hei-lou-lans-request",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_hei_lou_lan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Under Hei Lou Lan and Fairy Li Shan’s gaze, Fang Yuan uses open door Gu and close door Gu, and they draw no response. Both are inheritances of Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable, and Gu formations occupy the valley.",
        "chapters": [
          953
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "at-luo-po-valley",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fairy_li_shan",
          "sys_gu_formation"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan’s use of open door Gu at Luo Po Valley in his previous life brought nothing, and he took it that Shadow Sect had already broken Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable’s arrangement.",
        "chapters": [
          991
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "closing-the-true-inheritance-entrance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_shadow_sect"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In this life, open door Gu opens an entrance of light and a beam carries him into a Thieving Heaven true inheritance space, where he activates close door Gu and the shrinking entrance disappears. He then uses open door Gu again to form a new entrance, steps through it, and returns to Luo Po Valley, treating that cycle as proof that the information about both Gu is true. While clearing winds of assimilation inside, he repeatedly uses open door Gu and close door Gu to keep an exit near him. When Feng Jiu Ge flees through the entrance of light, Fang Yuan’s first action is to activate close door Gu and shut it.",
        "chapters": [
          991
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "closing-the-true-inheritance-entrance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "inh_thieving_heaven_true_inheritance",
          "char_feng_jiu_ge"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He later notes that clues for open door Gu and close door Gu were easy to obtain because Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable spread them widely for otherworldly demons.",
        "chapters": [
          992
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "closing-the-true-inheritance-entrance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
